WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.000
An AI coding agent builds a working tic-tac-toe feature inside Cursor.

00:06.000 --> 00:13.000
Unvibe appears beside the editor. The developer selects the changed code and presses Command U.

00:13.000 --> 00:25.000
Unvibe explains what changed, why it changed, and how the selected code fits into the project.

00:25.000 --> 00:36.000
The developer chooses an explanation level and asks a project-aware follow-up question.

00:36.000 --> 00:48.000
Test Me creates a comprehension check from the reviewed code and gives immediate feedback.

00:48.000 --> 01:00.000
The explanation is saved to the learning history so the developer can revisit the concept and track progress.
